<title>SWEDEN: Swedish unemployment 7.5 pct in April-Labour Board.</title>
<headline>Swedish unemployment 7.5 pct in April-Labour Board.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish unemployment fell to 7.5 percent in April from eight percent in March, the country's Labour Market Board (Ams) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH UNEMPLOYMENT	 April '97   March '97  April '96</p>
<p> Percent of workforce	 7.5	   8.0	  7.4</p>
<p> Number of unemployed	 318,000     339,000    312,000</p>
<p>Note - Sweden Statistics will release its unemployment figure for April at 1100 GMT on May 15. For March, unemployment amounted to 8.4 percent, it said.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1006</p>
